From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agrucza <a.grucza@gmx.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2732/2733] arm64: dts: qcom: Add the ASUS ProArt PZ13

The ASUS ProArt PZ13 (HT5306QA) is a 13" Snapdragon X Plus X1P-42-100
tablet with a detachable USB keyboard cover. Its tree is derived from
the Zenbook A14's and the PZ13's Windows ACPI tables. It describes the
display, GPU, NVMe, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, both USB-C ports with DisplayPort,
the touchscreen and pen, the keyboard cover, battery, lid switch, volume
buttons, speakers and microphones.

From github.com/agrucza/asus-proart-pz13-linux at 71c27d312a0e, under
the tree's BSD-3-Clause licence.

[birk: dropped the front, rear and IR camera nodes, their pin states and
the front camera's DVDD regulator, which need the X1P42100 CAMSS series
and sensor driver changes this kernel does not carry]
Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
