+	 * GPIOs tlmm 116/117 and the vreg_wcn_* fixed regulators are inherited
+	 * from the Zenbook A14; WLAN and Bluetooth come up with them.
+	 * PZ13-TODO: the DSDT also votes CLK7_A (RPMH_LN_BB_CLK2) for pcie4,
+	 * the WCN7850 reference clock; not described here yet.
